  1580→// ─── Trait AC N/A annotations ────────────────────────────────────────────────
  1581→
  1582→// @trait-error-guidance ACs are N/A for the dispatch engine:
  1583→// The dispatch engine is an internal runtime, not a CLI command. Error guidance
  1584→// traits apply to user-facing CLI commands, not to internal modules.
  1585→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-1 — N/A: dispatch engine is not a CLI command, errors are logged internally
  1586→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-2 — N/A: dispatch engine is not a CLI command, errors are logged internally
  1587→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-3 — N/A: dispatch engine is not a CLI command, no user-facing ref lookup
  1588→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-4 — N/A: dispatch engine is not a CLI command, no state transition errors shown to user
  1589→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-5 — N/A: dispatch engine is not a CLI command, no validation errors shown to user
  1590→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-6 — N/A: dispatch engine is not a CLI command, no JSON mode
  1591→
  1592→// ─── GetStatus ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  1593→
